flowchart TD
    %% Sources: prope_source_of_truth.md Insight 6, 10.6, S3, H-06, open questions; business-analysis.md FR-01/NFR-01.

    start([Start: owner wants to control prompt access])
    detail[Prompt Detail]
    permission{Permission to manage access?\nRules: Unverified / TBD}
    denied[Access Unavailable]
    access[Access and Ownership]
    action{Choose action}
    level{Access level}
    saved[Access Saved and Activity Recorded]
    transfer[Transfer Ownership]
    confirm[Confirm Ownership Transfer]
    confirmed{Confirm transfer?}
    transferred[Ownership Transfer Recorded]
    ownership_tbd[Unverified / TBD: owner, steward, and transfer rules]
    end([End: ownership or access updated])

    start -->|Open prompt| detail
    detail -->|Manage access| permission
    permission -->|No| denied
    denied -->|Return to prompt| detail
    permission -->|Yes| access
    access --> action
    action -->|Keep private or grant access| level
    level -->|Private| saved
    level -->|Team| saved
    level -->|Organization| saved
    saved --> end
    action -->|Transfer ownership| transfer
    transfer --> ownership_tbd
    ownership_tbd -->|Continue with known confirmation requirement| confirm
    confirm --> confirmed
    confirmed -->|Cancel| access
    confirmed -->|Confirm| transferred
    transferred --> end

